node_modules/
# ⚠️ ANCHORED. A bare `dist/` matches a directory of that name at ANY depth, which once silently
# swallowed a nested build output and shipped it empty, with nothing saying so.
/dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Editors
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Build / test output
*.tgz
coverage/
*.log

# Local environment
.env
.env.*

# ⚠️ `CLAUDE.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `.claude/` and `.agents/` are COMMITTED. All four are dspec's own
# output, written by `dspec init` from `templates/` — nothing reads `.ds/` to produce them. They
# are committed so a teammate gets the slash command and the map instructions on clone, without
# installing anything. Never edit them by hand; re-run `dspec init`.
#
# ⚠️ Codex is the exception and cannot be committed: its prompts load only from the user's own
# home directory, so a teammate runs `dspec init` once themselves.
.ds/config.json
CLAUDE.local.md
